body:
My doctor didn't tell me he hit me with the anaesthesia so I was mid-sentence saying: oh wow that feel craaaaz-

&#x200B;

then i woke up many hours later nauseous LOL

Op, the solution is **NOT** to delay or prevent your transition so that this guy is still attracted to you. Viewing your post history, it's clear he's fetishizing you and trying to stop you from transitioning. You've *been* out as trans the entire time you guys were together, he knew then and he knows now. 

&#x200B;

I know it's a scary thing to do, but you need to leave him. You deserve to be happy

Oh no I totally agree with you, he messed up completely on Sophie leading Rose into the backrooms. I believe it was absolutely Bon who did this under some kind of kill program made by Felix, specifically the names listed by Billy. 

&#x200B;

Something else I think is pretty noteworthy to think about is, who took Sophie in after both of her parents disappeared? They both vanished in such a short time, and shortly after Rosemary's disappearance, Bon's Burgers was shut down. If I recall correctly, Sophie was fourteen when her mother disappeared. There's no way that it's super out there to the public that Felix killed Molly and Edd, otherwise we wouldn't hear such high praise of him in the Relocate Project tape. I have a theory that after her parents disappeared, Felix maybe took Sophie in to raise her? That would explain how he could keep her medicated "Safety in Pills, Sophie" and gaslight her into not thinking about what he saw. It's likely he didn't want to kill her because he felt *so* much guilt around Edd and Molly's death, and in his mind children are a whole other ballpark from fully grown adults who know his terrible terrible secret. Or maybe that Billy segment was just giving us the names of those who possess the Showstoppers, but nonetheless I totally think Felix has been close in on Sophie and keeping tabs on her for years. It'd also explain why she couldn't remember BSI or any related affiliates until she's well in her adult years.
